  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovative approaches for the financial inclusion of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) in Jordan &#x2013; GIZ I-FIN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I-FIN is a Deutsche Gesellschaft f&#xfc;r Internationale Zusammenarbeit (GIZ) implemented financial system development project aiming to improve the access to innovative financial services for growth-oriented micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) in Jordan. The project is implemented in close cooperation with the Central Bank of Jordan and with full endorsement of the Jordanian Government. The project has a 10 million EUR Bundesministerium f&#xfc;r wirtschaftliche Zusammenarbeit und Entwicklung (BMZ) budget for the four-year period 2021-2025 which is fully committed. The GIZ team proposed expanding the successful initiatives for lasting impact, maximizing results and achieving extra targets through additional financing from the Netherlands (Directorate-General for International Cooperation of the MFA) for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
